<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Iru Custom Profile "Sable: Computer use (Orca, Claude, ChatGPT)" (docs/iru.md). Sable Trial and
     Sable Trial (idle). Needs a supervised Mac (Automated Device Enrollment). Accessibility,
     PostEvent and Automation of System Events and Finder are allowed outright for all seven
     ids. Screen Recording (ScreenCapture, which also covers system audio) can't be allowed by any
     MDM: macOS only takes Deny or AllowStandardUserToSetSystemService. This profile sets
     AllowStandardUserToSetSystemService for Orca and Orca Computer Use only, so the person at the
     Mac turns those on once per Mac (docs/new-mac-runbook.md, Part F). Claude and ChatGPT have no
     ScreenCapture entry. forceBypassScreenCaptureAlert stops the monthly re-prompt once it's on.
     Code requirements are each app's designated requirement (codesign -dr -,
     Orca 1.4.271, Claude 6.28899.6, ChatGPT 26.1117.41037); a check is mdm/iru-computer-use-check.sh. -->
<plist version="1.0">
